window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She ran from devils... into the arms of a monster.</b></p> <p>She was a forced sin servant praying for death. Until the day she decided to run—right into my arms.</p> <p>One touch, and I know she's mine. One taste, and I know she belongs to me.</p> <p>My good little human will only truly be free when she's on my tight leash.</p> <p>Her time as her own person ends now. Her life as my property is just beginning.</p>"; 
